 Department of Health, Education, and Welfare.\n(4) Director, United States Secret Service, Department of the  \nTreasury.\n(5)  Associate Directors, (4) Office of Management and Budget, Ex­\necutive Office of the President.\n(6) Deputy Under Secretary for Legislative Affaire, Department of  \nLabor.\n(7) Director of Program Analysis and Evaluation, Department of  \nD","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_11768.txt","sha256":"bf4aee9346b856ccaf17051818c6cc6267d6487558e473578554efbdb8da6ca0","source":{"line":1436,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"243957636ef8c3a1ec571b2ec8b70d2fa281c968502badc5bba7afbb4f4c4a59"}}]}
